[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":95},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:8":3},{"posts":4,"total":86,"tags":87,"tag":-1},[5,14,23,32,37,45,53,62,70,78],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"The F2E - 第二屆 前端 & UI 修練精神時光屋","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-06-14-the_f2e","2019\u002F06\u002F14","2019-06-14","你想變強嗎？你想獲得力量嗎？你想透過前端改變你的生活，但找不到地方修練嗎？如果你的答案是「Yes」那麼你來對地方了！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F06%2FF2E-2nd-1200x628.png?alt=media&token=3e297d87-8c3a-492a-8759-89af4ecd4c90",[13],"skilltree",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"【大神來六角】六月直播主題：檔案傳輸","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-05-22-god-and-hexschool","2019\u002F05\u002F22","2019-05-22","身為軟體工程師，最常打交道就是「檔案」，舉凡是圖片、壓縮檔、office 文件都是能透過網際網路進行傳輸，其代表性的雲服務為 AWS S3 、Google Cloud Storage、Firebase Storage，本月直播的主題將會對檔案進行深入探討。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F05%2F%E5%A4%A7%E7%A5%9E-topic-june.png?alt=media&token=f7b42442-6f42-4e10-920c-4896fe2fb455",[22],"event",{"title":24,"link":25,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":28,"thumbnail":29,"tags":30},"【徵人】【高雄】實習生 1~3 名","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-05-13-internship","2019\u002F05\u002F13","2019-05-13","六角學院 是一所線上程式開發學習單位，目前已累積超過 15,000 名學員，**讓更多人藉由線上學習在職涯規劃上有更多的選擇**是我們的使命是，如果您贊同我們的理念，歡迎加入六角。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F05%2Fhex-hire-intern-fb.png?alt=media&token=dffc89f2-dc10-4e2f-ba74-e4c45697f692",[31],"jobs",{"title":33,"link":34,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":28,"thumbnail":35,"tags":36},"【學員專屬徵才 - 遠端助教】無程式工作經驗者優先錄取","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-05-13-remote-jobs","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F05%2Fhex-hire-TA-fb.png?alt=media&token=de1fb813-9419-4620-bdee-67cae3c686a9",[31],{"title":38,"link":39,"date":40,"dateTime":41,"description":42,"thumbnail":43,"tags":44},"【大神來六角】五月直播主題：後端開發","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-04-17-god-and-hexschool","2019\u002F04\u002F17","2019-04-17","後端語言五花八門，各語言都有它的優缺點，但要你真的去選擇一門來研究，是否常常無法決定？所以本月的主題，我們邀請到四位在各後端領域都有一定水準的工程師，來為各位進行分享。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F04%2F%E5%A4%A7%E7%A5%9E-topic-may.png?alt=media&token=57390c12-1a08-44d3-9eaa-4b9784d4b382",[22],{"title":46,"link":47,"date":48,"dateTime":49,"description":50,"thumbnail":51,"tags":52},"【大神來六角】四月直播主題：計算機網路！","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-03-07-interview","2019\u002F03\u002F07","2019-03-07","在前端工程師在處理後端 API 串接時，當發生各種異常狀況，會不曉得該如何抽絲剝繭查出問題所在，本月主題希望藉此來介紹，「發出網路請求時，網路底層過程中會發生哪些事？」，以下直播將會帶你\u002F妳學會以下內容。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F03%2F%E5%A4%A7%E7%A5%9E%E4%BE%86%E5%85%AD%E8%A7%92-%E4%B8%BB%E9%A1%8C.png?alt=media&token=3d0ec578-4118-4b65-9bd4-42b8198da79a",[22],{"title":54,"link":55,"date":56,"dateTime":57,"description":58,"thumbnail":59,"tags":60},"不斷地檢視自己，才能看清實力，無謂的擔心都只是局限了未來的可能性！ -- 育榛","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-01-08-interview","2019\u002F01\u002F08","2019-01-08","「不可能成功！」、「這只有邏輯好的人才適合做！」、「比起他人，我的實力真的差太多了！」這些否定自己的字眼，總在學習的路上不斷地提醒育榛，讓她對程式語言既期待又怕受傷害，總是駐足不前，但在第一份工作離職後，決心學好前端技術，在加入六角學院後，才發現不過就是自己侷限了自己！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F01%2Fblog-cover-%E8%82%B2%E6%A6%9B.png?alt=media&token=c50d62a0-20ee-4739-ad01-4321cb98de7f",[61],"interview",{"title":63,"link":64,"date":65,"dateTime":66,"description":67,"thumbnail":68,"tags":69},"努力累積能夠代表自己的作品，作品可以說明一切實力！ -- 貫宇","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-01-06-interview","2019\u002F01\u002F06","2019-01-06","淡江大學資訊傳播學系出身的貫宇，憑藉著對 coding 的想像，一頭栽進了前端技術領域。貫宇：「當你學得越多，越會知道自己知識有多淺薄。」途中遭受挫折的他\t在第一份工作中，又重拾了對網頁技術的熱情，這次他決定再給自己一次機會，而且要做就要完整，沒有退路！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F01%2Fblog-cover-%E8%B2%AB%E5%AE%87.png?alt=media&token=1663153e-9bd5-40cc-a839-5a97b9cef264",[61],{"title":71,"link":72,"date":73,"dateTime":74,"description":75,"thumbnail":76,"tags":77},"老闆不會為你規劃人生。未來想成為什麼？是自己決定的！-- Kanboo","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-01-03-interview","2019\u002F01\u002F03","2019-01-03","Kanboo 的前一份工作是在專案公司，協助竹科、金融企業內部系統開發，遇過許多不同的企業需求與企業文化，這個經歷對 Kanboo 的人生規劃有著很大的影響，Kanboo 感謝家人願意支持他轉職的決心，現在他是一名前端工程師。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F01%2Fblog-cover-Kanboo.png?alt=media&token=add3a589-38a5-49bb-9da6-420915dcce26",[61],{"title":79,"link":80,"date":81,"dateTime":82,"description":83,"thumbnail":84,"tags":85},"【Adobe XD-Plugins】超快一鍵匯入真實資料","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-10-31-adobe-plugins","2018\u002F10\u002F31","2018-10-31","Adobe XD 最近更新加入了 Plugins 功能（插件），開發者們也摩拳擦掌的加入各種好用功能，讓設計師們可以輕鬆活用這些 Plugins。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F10%2Fxd-plugin-cover_GoogleSheets.png?alt=media&token=72bb302b-89eb-47ba-8a7b-17cbc64c238b",[22],116,[88,89,90,91,92,22,61,93,31,13,94],"UI design","course","css","css3","enterprise","javascript","software engineer",1790064292967]